# Line endings of the Web graph, which is written on Windows, Linux and macOS alike: git keeps them
# LF, which is what .editorconfig asks for, instead of letting the editor of the day decide whether a
# file is committed with CRLF. `text=auto` leaves whatever git reads as binary (images, fonts) alone.
/Blazor.WorkflowEditor/**       text=auto eol=lf
/Blazor.WorkflowEditor.Tests/** text=auto eol=lf
/WorkflowEditor.Web/**          text=auto eol=lf
